	(text "We need a powered output and switch for the LED ring. \nIdeally, a constant-current LED driver would be used\nalthough I'd like to keep the option open to use a\nmulti-spectral led source which will probably want one\nchannel per LED. For now, maybe just a constant-current \nserial output?"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 38.1 21.844 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "3675d600-c88d-41da-9323-2d1a8891e73c")
	)
